          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "xìngmíng is built from xìng 'a surname' and 名 'a name', both inherited from Middle Chinese, sjengH and mjieng (Guangyun, in Baxter's transcription)."
